    },
    {
      "name": "Creepy Doll Collection",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "passive",
        "description": "<p>Countdown (5). Throughout the hut, the PCs can see many, many porcelain or wooden dolls with strangely lifelike eyes. When the party first enters a doll's line of sight, activate the countdown. It ticks down when a PC fails a roll or rolls with Fear. When it triggers, the dolls come to life and attack. Summon a number of living dolls (Redcap Biters) equal to twice the number of PCs.</p><section id=\"secret-kX6Wcczg4Dy60u1v\" class=\"secret\"><p>Who were these dolls before? Is there any way to free them from their imprisonment?</p></section>",
        "attribution": {},
        "gmNotes": "",
        "resource": null,
