    {
      "name": "Dislocated",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "reaction",
        "description": "<p>Time moves differently inside the Witch's Hut. When the door to the hut is closed, roll a <strong>d6</strong>. On a result of 4 or higher, the hut moves to a different—often impossibly far–location that's only revealed to the PCs when they open the hut's door again.</p><section id=\"secret-jtpKo8ZEjpN47XcJ\" class=\"secret\"><p>Why does the hut move so often? Where does it wish to bring the PCs? Is there any way to aim it at a specific location?</p></section>",
        "attribution": {},
